{"sha":"e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448","node_id":"C_kwDOS72PRtoAKGUyZjBmMWZkNjlkZGJmYmYzODRlOTg0YTdkYjRkMmMyNzI2NzQ0NDg","commit":{"author":{"name":"JiveOff","email":"antoine@jiveoff.fr","date":"2026-06-19T02:17:05Z"},"committer":{"name":"JiveOff","email":"antoine@jiveoff.fr","date":"2026-06-19T02:17:05Z"},"message":"ci: unify CI and release into single workflow, remove nightly\n\n- Merges ci.yml into release.yml (deleted ci.yml)\n- Single workflow: Build → Test → Integration → ONNX validate → Benchmark → Release\n- Release job uses github.ref directly — no workflow_run, no self-loop risk\n- Stable (vX.Y.Z) / Beta (vX.Y.Z-* or branch with prerelease version) / Skip\n- Removes nightly schedule trigger\n- Removes quality classifier checks (stay on beta-quality branch only)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b64c65817ed936574680050592094039c35875c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/git/trees/6b64c65817ed936574680050592094039c35875c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/git/commits/e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEEVhjYFCqchaib4AcrKuO0z6JAa5EFAmo0pqEACgkQKuO0z6JA\na5GLhwv/btuBrp+5GVtnSlnbDx7u0XhD68LQIY2XrM8VMEcGwDbfxOSUDyP7K8im\n+UNAQ0Sm1bNIW6/chsGCJudsvwrp4RqKPxAO+JwCVbEKruyYQALovkxnFRt/uacQ\nc8DGpZy0OCZsY4D07+I8ztAVo7fmbv+dV1bdLmFb/PxcgilEoidePmz7p3yPqTL6\nKXIo24Rqomkl1ApjIVyN15o8gkVHlu3IsXd7WxXI5lvaiXb9kjgUOoMKKWqXLZQ3\nUm06uUmW63PBEPQt3r1x1QEKDg1dzPa2Y+m79OP2A/jW6rqpZwt5bO1BTpwxD00T\nucOhK4meyJ1mYZHIsJt03vgHdiA1yVv4eepy+1rojzQXPJelMvleQ7nADvI3CEuT\nvDFFOQnVD8QTQjUB2APV38tV8ryaSq/osUMc4gWrgtDkWEEh/pvX48cLy1/Xrp0y\nOynSN0VFyAiU05JeEIqnFzkCwA/olpgoGWyPIX31o03EMv+mE5lRLN/n1NGewYNe\n5CdzS1s7\n=8TO7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 6b64c65817ed936574680050592094039c35875c\nparent 3e09c4be834522ecfddc376d60e33d6c9fdd1069\nauthor JiveOff <antoine@jiveoff.fr> 1781835425 +0200\ncommitter JiveOff <antoine@jiveoff.fr> 1781835425 +0200\n\nci: unify CI and release into single workflow, remove nightly\n\n- Merges ci.yml into release.yml (deleted ci.yml)\n- Single workflow: Build → Test → Integration → ONNX validate → Benchmark → Release\n- Release job uses github.ref directly — no workflow_run, no self-loop risk\n- Stable (vX.Y.Z) / Beta (vX.Y.Z-* or branch with prerelease version) / Skip\n- Removes nightly schedule trigger\n- Removes quality classifier checks (stay on beta-quality branch only)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","verified_at":"2026-06-19T02:17:13Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/commits/e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448","html_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/commit/e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/commits/e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448/comments","author":{"login":"JiveOff","id":24374817,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0Mzc0ODE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24374817?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff","html_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"JiveOff","id":24374817,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0Mzc0ODE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24374817?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff","html_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JiveOff/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3e09c4be834522ecfddc376d60e33d6c9fdd1069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/commits/3e09c4be834522ecfddc376d60e33d6c9fdd1069","html_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/commit/3e09c4be834522ecfddc376d60e33d6c9fdd1069"}],"stats":{"total":630,"additions":344,"deletions":286},"files":[{"sha":"72b9f951119c119a04e3f0233af7a70e66fa9c6c","filename":".github/workflows/ci.yml","status":"removed","additions":0,"deletions":247,"changes":247,"blob_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/blob/3e09c4be834522ecfddc376d60e33d6c9fdd1069/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fci.yml","raw_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/raw/3e09c4be834522ecfddc376d60e33d6c9fdd1069/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fci.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/contents/.github%2Fworkflows%2Fci.yml?ref=3e09c4be834522ecfddc376d60e33d6c9fdd1069","patch":"@@ -1,247 +0,0 @@\n-name: CI\n-\n-on:\n-  push:\n-    branches: ['**', '!gh-benchmarks']\n-    tags: ['v[0-9]*']\n-  pull_request:\n-  schedule:\n-    - cron: '0 2 * * *'   # nightly at 02:00 UTC\n-  workflow_dispatch:\n-\n-permissions:\n-  contents: write\n-  checks: write\n-\n-jobs:\n-  build:\n-    name: Build\n-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n-\n-    steps:\n-      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n-\n-      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n-        with:\n-          version: 9\n-\n-      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n-        with:\n-          node-version: '20'\n-          cache: pnpm\n-          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n-\n-      - name: Install dependencies\n-        working-directory: js\n-        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n-\n-      - name: Build library\n-        working-directory: js\n-        run: pnpm --filter bs-map-classifier run build\n-\n-      - name: Build extension & userscript\n-        working-directory: js\n-        run: pnpm --filter bs-pattern-overlay run build\n-\n-      - name: Install Vue demo\n-        working-directory: js/lib/examples/vue-beatsaver\n-        run: pnpm install\n-\n-      - name: Typecheck & build Vue demo\n-        working-directory: js/lib/examples/vue-beatsaver\n-        run: pnpm run build\n-\n-      - name: Upload dist artifact\n-        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n-        with:\n-          name: lib-dist\n-          path: js/lib/dist/\n-\n-  test:\n-    name: Test (Node ${{ matrix.node }})\n-    needs: build\n-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n-    strategy:\n-      fail-fast: false\n-      matrix:\n-        node: ['18', '20', '22', '24']\n-\n-    steps:\n-      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n-\n-      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n-        with:\n-          version: 9\n-\n-      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n-        with:\n-          node-version: ${{ matrix.node }}\n-          cache: pnpm\n-          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n-\n-      - name: Install dependencies\n-        working-directory: js\n-        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n-\n-      - name: Download dist artifact\n-        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n-        with:\n-          name: lib-dist\n-          path: js/lib/dist/\n-\n-      - name: Unit tests (ESM)\n-        working-directory: js/lib\n-        run: node --test --test-reporter=spec tests/*.test.js\n-\n-      - name: Smoke test — CJS (require)\n-        working-directory: js/lib\n-        run: |\n-          node -e \"\n-            const pkg = require('./dist/cjs/index.js');\n-            const fns = ['loadClassifierFromBuffers', 'classifyMap', 'parseBeatmap', 'computeFeatures', 'annotatePatterns'];\n-            for (const fn of fns) {\n-              if (typeof pkg[fn] !== 'function') throw new Error('CJS missing export: ' + fn);\n-            }\n-            console.log('CJS exports OK:', fns.join(', '));\n-          \"\n-\n-      - name: Smoke test — embedded ESM bundle\n-        working-directory: js/lib\n-        run: |\n-          node --input-type=module --eval \"\n-            import { loadEmbeddedClassifier } from './dist/embedded.mjs';\n-            if (typeof loadEmbeddedClassifier !== 'function')\n-              throw new Error('embedded.mjs missing loadEmbeddedClassifier');\n-            console.log('embedded.mjs export OK');\n-          \"\n-\n-  integration:\n-    name: Integration (live BeatSaver)\n-    needs: build\n-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n-\n-    steps:\n-      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n-\n-      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n-        with:\n-          version: 9\n-\n-      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n-        with:\n-          node-version: '20'\n-          cache: pnpm\n-          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n-\n-      - name: Install dependencies\n-        working-directory: js\n-        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n-\n-      - name: Download dist artifact\n-        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n-        with:\n-          name: lib-dist\n-          path: js/lib/dist/\n-\n-      - name: Run integration tests\n-        working-directory: js/lib\n-        env:\n-          INTEGRATION: '1'\n-        run: node --test --test-reporter=spec tests/integration.test.js\n-\n-  validate-onnx:\n-    name: ONNX smoke test\n-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n-\n-    steps:\n-      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n-\n-      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n-        with:\n-          python-version: '3.11'\n-\n-      - name: Install onnxruntime\n-        run: pip install onnxruntime numpy --quiet\n-\n-      - name: Smoke test — pattern_classifier.onnx loads and produces valid output\n-        run: |\n-          python - <<'EOF'\n-          import json, sys\n-          import numpy as np\n-          import onnxruntime as rt\n-\n-          CLASSES = {'Accuracy', 'Extreme', 'Speed', 'Standard', 'Tech'}\n-          MODEL   = 'models/onnx/pattern_classifier.onnx'\n-          META    = 'models/onnx/pattern_classifier_meta.json'\n-\n-          meta = json.loads(open(META).read())\n-          n    = meta['n_features']\n-          assert set(meta['classes']) == CLASSES, f\"Unexpected classes: {meta['classes']}\"\n-          assert len(meta['imputer_medians']) == n, 'imputer_medians length mismatch'\n-          assert len(meta['scaler_mean'])     == n, 'scaler_mean length mismatch'\n-          assert len(meta['scaler_scale'])    == n, 'scaler_scale length mismatch'\n-\n-          sess     = rt.InferenceSession(MODEL)\n-          inp_name = sess.get_inputs()[0].name\n-          dummy    = np.zeros((1, n), dtype=np.float32)\n-          labels, probs = sess.run(None, {inp_name: dummy})\n-\n-          assert labels.shape == (1,),   f'Unexpected label shape: {labels.shape}'\n-          assert probs.shape  == (1, 5), f'Unexpected prob shape: {probs.shape}'\n-          # labels[0] is an integer class index (0–4); look it up in meta['classes']\n-          class_idx = int(labels[0])\n-          assert 0 <= class_idx < len(meta['classes']), f'Class index out of range: {class_idx}'\n-          assert abs(probs[0].sum() - 1.0) < 1e-4, 'Probabilities do not sum to 1'\n-\n-          predicted = meta['classes'][class_idx]\n-          print(f'OK — {n} features, prediction: {predicted} ({probs[0].max():.1%})')\n-          EOF\n-\n-  benchmark:\n-    name: Benchmark\n-    needs: build\n-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n-    # Only store results on main — PRs and branches still run the benchmark but don't push\n-    steps:\n-      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n-\n-      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n-        with:\n-          version: 9\n-\n-      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n-        with:\n-          node-version: '20'\n-          cache: pnpm\n-          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n-\n-      - name: Install dependencies\n-        working-directory: js\n-        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n-\n-      - name: Download dist artifact\n-        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n-        with:\n-          name: lib-dist\n-          path: js/lib/dist/\n-\n-      - name: Run benchmark\n-        working-directory: js/lib\n-        env:\n-          BENCHMARK_OUTPUT: benchmark-results.json\n-        run: node scripts/benchmark.mjs\n-\n-      - name: Store benchmark results\n-        uses: benchmark-action/github-action-benchmark@v1\n-        if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main'\n-        with:\n-          name: bs-map-classifier\n-          tool: customSmallerIsBetter\n-          output-file-path: js/lib/benchmark-results.json\n-          gh-pages-branch: gh-benchmarks\n-          benchmark-data-dir-path: benchmarks\n-          github-token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n-          auto-push: true\n-          comment-on-alert: true\n-          alert-threshold: '150%'\n-          fail-on-alert: false"},{"sha":"7f393677f2a4f01a910921282e3d4496969303a9","filename":".github/workflows/release.yml","status":"modified","additions":344,"deletions":39,"changes":383,"blob_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/blob/e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frelease.yml","raw_url":"https://github.com/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/raw/e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frelease.yml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JiveOff/bs-map-classifier/contents/.github%2Fworkflows%2Frelease.yml?ref=e2f0f1fd69ddbfbf384e984a7db4d2c272674448","patch":"@@ -1,24 +1,276 @@\n-name: Release\n+name: CI / Release\n \n on:\n-  workflow_run:\n-    workflows: ['CI']\n-    types: [completed]\n+  push:\n+    branches: ['**', '!gh-benchmarks']\n+    tags: ['v[0-9]*']\n+  pull_request:\n+  workflow_dispatch:\n \n permissions:\n   id-token: write\n-  contents: write   # required to create GitHub Releases\n+  contents: write\n+  checks: write\n+\n+# ── Build ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n \n jobs:\n+  build:\n+    name: Build\n+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n+\n+    steps:\n+      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n+\n+      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n+        with:\n+          version: 9\n+\n+      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n+        with:\n+          node-version: '20'\n+          cache: pnpm\n+          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n+\n+      - name: Install dependencies\n+        working-directory: js\n+        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n+\n+      - name: Build library\n+        working-directory: js\n+        run: pnpm --filter bs-map-classifier run build\n+\n+      - name: Build extension & userscript\n+        working-directory: js\n+        run: pnpm --filter bs-pattern-overlay run build\n+\n+      - name: Install Vue demo\n+        working-directory: js/lib/examples/vue-beatsaver\n+        run: pnpm install\n+\n+      - name: Typecheck & build Vue demo\n+        working-directory: js/lib/examples/vue-beatsaver\n+        run: pnpm run build\n+\n+      - name: Upload dist artifact\n+        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n+        with:\n+          name: lib-dist\n+          path: js/lib/dist/\n+\n+# ── Test ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+\n+  test:\n+    name: Test (Node ${{ matrix.node }})\n+    needs: build\n+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n+    strategy:\n+      fail-fast: false\n+      matrix:\n+        node: ['18', '20', '22', '24']\n+\n+    steps:\n+      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n+\n+      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n+        with:\n+          version: 9\n+\n+      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n+        with:\n+          node-version: ${{ matrix.node }}\n+          cache: pnpm\n+          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n+\n+      - name: Install dependencies\n+        working-directory: js\n+        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n+\n+      - name: Download dist artifact\n+        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n+        with:\n+          name: lib-dist\n+          path: js/lib/dist/\n+\n+      - name: Unit tests (ESM)\n+        working-directory: js/lib\n+        run: node --test --test-reporter=spec tests/*.test.js\n+\n+      - name: Smoke test — CJS (require)\n+        working-directory: js/lib\n+        run: |\n+          node -e \"\n+            const pkg = require('./dist/cjs/index.js');\n+            const fns = ['loadClassifierFromBuffers', 'classifyMap', 'parseBeatmap', 'computeFeatures', 'annotatePatterns'];\n+            for (const fn of fns) {\n+              if (typeof pkg[fn] !== 'function') throw new Error('CJS missing export: ' + fn);\n+            }\n+            console.log('CJS exports OK:', fns.join(', '));\n+          \"\n+\n+      - name: Smoke test — embedded ESM bundle\n+        working-directory: js/lib\n+        run: |\n+          node --input-type=module --eval \"\n+            import { loadEmbeddedClassifier } from './dist/embedded.mjs';\n+            if (typeof loadEmbeddedClassifier !== 'function')\n+              throw new Error('embedded.mjs missing loadEmbeddedClassifier');\n+            console.log('embedded.mjs export OK');\n+          \"\n+\n+# ── Integration ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+\n+  integration:\n+    name: Integration (live BeatSaver)\n+    needs: build\n+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n+\n+    steps:\n+      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n+\n+      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n+        with:\n+          version: 9\n+\n+      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n+        with:\n+          node-version: '20'\n+          cache: pnpm\n+          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n+\n+      - name: Install dependencies\n+        working-directory: js\n+        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n+\n+      - name: Download dist artifact\n+        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n+        with:\n+          name: lib-dist\n+          path: js/lib/dist/\n+\n+      - name: Run integration tests\n+        working-directory: js/lib\n+        env:\n+          INTEGRATION: '1'\n+        run: node --test --test-reporter=spec tests/integration.test.js\n+\n+# ── ONNX smoke test ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+\n+  validate-onnx:\n+    name: ONNX smoke test\n+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n+\n+    steps:\n+      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n+\n+      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n+        with:\n+          python-version: '3.11'\n+\n+      - name: Install onnxruntime\n+        run: pip install onnxruntime numpy --quiet\n+\n+      - name: Smoke test — pattern_classifier.onnx\n+        run: |\n+          python - <<'EOF'\n+          import json\n+          import numpy as np\n+          import onnxruntime as rt\n+\n+          CLASSES = {'Accuracy', 'Extreme', 'Speed', 'Standard', 'Tech'}\n+          MODEL   = 'models/onnx/pattern_classifier.onnx'\n+          META    = 'models/onnx/pattern_classifier_meta.json'\n+\n+          meta = json.loads(open(META).read())\n+          n    = meta['n_features']\n+          assert set(meta['classes']) == CLASSES, f\"Unexpected classes: {meta['classes']}\"\n+          assert len(meta['imputer_medians']) == n, 'imputer_medians length mismatch'\n+          assert len(meta['scaler_mean'])     == n, 'scaler_mean length mismatch'\n+          assert len(meta['scaler_scale'])    == n, 'scaler_scale length mismatch'\n+\n+          sess     = rt.InferenceSession(MODEL)\n+          inp_name = sess.get_inputs()[0].name\n+          dummy    = np.zeros((1, n), dtype=np.float32)\n+          labels, probs = sess.run(None, {inp_name: dummy})\n+\n+          assert labels.shape == (1,),   f'Unexpected label shape: {labels.shape}'\n+          assert probs.shape  == (1, 5), f'Unexpected prob shape: {probs.shape}'\n+          class_idx = int(labels[0])\n+          assert 0 <= class_idx < len(meta['classes']), f'Class index out of range: {class_idx}'\n+          assert abs(probs[0].sum() - 1.0) < 1e-4, 'Probabilities do not sum to 1'\n+\n+          predicted = meta['classes'][class_idx]\n+          print(f'OK — {n} features, prediction: {predicted} ({probs[0].max():.1%})')\n+          EOF\n+\n+# ── Benchmark ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+\n+  benchmark:\n+    name: Benchmark\n+    needs: build\n+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n+\n+    steps:\n+      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n+\n+      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n+        with:\n+          version: 9\n+\n+      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n+        with:\n+          node-version: '20'\n+          cache: pnpm\n+          cache-dependency-path: js/pnpm-lock.yaml\n+\n+      - name: Install dependencies\n+        working-directory: js\n+        run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n+\n+      - name: Download dist artifact\n+        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n+        with:\n+          name: lib-dist\n+          path: js/lib/dist/\n+\n+      - name: Run benchmark\n+        working-directory: js/lib\n+        env:\n+          BENCHMARK_OUTPUT: benchmark-results.json\n+        run: node scripts/benchmark.mjs\n+\n+      - name: Store benchmark results\n+        uses: benchmark-action/github-action-benchmark@v1\n+        if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main'\n+        with:\n+          name: bs-map-classifier\n+          tool: customSmallerIsBetter\n+          output-file-path: js/lib/benchmark-results.json\n+          gh-pages-branch: gh-benchmarks\n+          benchmark-data-dir-path: benchmarks\n+          github-token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n+          auto-push: true\n+          comment-on-alert: true\n+          alert-threshold: '150%'\n+          fail-on-alert: false\n+\n+# ── Release ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+\n   release:\n+    name: Release\n+    needs: [build, test]\n     runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n-    if: github.event.workflow_run.conclusion == 'success' && github.event.workflow_run.event == 'push' && startsWith(github.event.workflow_run.head_branch, 'v')\n+    # Only on v-tags or non-main branch pushes (potential beta)\n+    if: |\n+      github.event_name == 'push' && (\n+        startsWith(github.ref, 'refs/tags/v') ||\n+        (github.ref != 'refs/heads/main' && github.ref != 'refs/heads/gh-benchmarks')\n+      )\n \n     steps:\n       - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n         with:\n-          ref: ${{ github.event.workflow_run.head_sha }}\n-          fetch-depth: 0   # full history lets softprops generate accurate release notes\n+          fetch-depth: 0\n \n       - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4\n         with:\n@@ -29,17 +281,43 @@ jobs:\n           node-version: '24'\n           registry-url: 'https://registry.npmjs.org'\n \n-      # ── Extract semver from tag (v1.2.3 → 1.2.3) ─────────────────────────\n-      - name: Extract version\n-        id: ver\n+      # ── Determine release type ───────────────────────────────────────────────\n+      # stable : vX.Y.Z tag (no prerelease suffix)\n+      # beta   : vX.Y.Z-* tag  OR  non-main branch where package.json version has '-'\n+      # skip   : non-main branch without a prerelease version\n+      - name: Determine release type\n+        id: rel\n         run: |\n-          TAG=\"${{ github.event.workflow_run.head_branch }}\"\n-          echo \"VERSION=${TAG#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+          REF=\"${{ github.ref }}\"\n+          REF_NAME=\"${{ github.ref_name }}\"\n+\n+          if [[ \"$REF\" == refs/tags/v* ]]; then\n+            VERSION=\"${REF_NAME#v}\"\n+            if [[ \"$VERSION\" == *-* ]]; then\n+              echo \"type=beta\"   >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+            else\n+              echo \"type=stable\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+            fi\n+            echo \"VERSION=$VERSION\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+            echo \"tag=v$VERSION\"    >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+\n+          else\n+            # Branch push — check package.json for a prerelease version\n+            VERSION=$(node -p \"require('./js/lib/package.json').version\")\n+            if [[ \"$VERSION\" == *-* ]]; then\n+              echo \"type=beta\"        >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+              echo \"VERSION=$VERSION\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+              echo \"tag=v$VERSION\"    >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+            else\n+              echo \"type=skip\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n+            fi\n+          fi\n \n-      # ── Patch version into every manifest that carries it ─────────────────\n-      - name: Patch versions\n+      # ── Patch versions into manifests (stable only) ──────────────────────────\n+      - name: Patch versions (stable)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'stable'\n         env:\n-          V: ${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}\n+          V: ${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}\n         run: |\n           patch() {\n             node -e \"\n@@ -53,51 +331,78 @@ jobs:\n           patch js/extension/package.json\n           patch js/extension/public/manifest.json\n \n-      # ── Install workspace deps ─────────────────────────────────────────────\n+      # ── Install & build ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n       - name: Install dependencies\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type != 'skip'\n         working-directory: js\n         run: pnpm install --ignore-scripts\n \n-      # ── Build library: ESM source is ready; compile CJS ───────────────────\n-      - name: Build library (CJS)\n-        working-directory: js\n-        run: pnpm --filter bs-map-classifier run build\n+      - name: Download dist artifact\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type != 'skip'\n+        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n+        with:\n+          name: lib-dist\n+          path: js/lib/dist/\n \n-      # ── Build extension + self-contained userscript ────────────────────────\n-      - name: Build extension & userscript\n+      - name: Build extension & userscript (stable)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'stable'\n         working-directory: js\n         env:\n-          RELEASE_VERSION: ${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}\n+          RELEASE_VERSION: ${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}\n         run: pnpm --filter bs-pattern-overlay run build\n \n-      # ── Package artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\n-      - name: Package extension zip\n+      # ── Package artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+      - name: Package extension zip (stable)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'stable'\n         working-directory: js/dist/extension\n-        run: zip -r ../../bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}.zip .\n+        run: zip -r ../../bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}.zip .\n \n       - name: Package library zip\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type != 'skip'\n         working-directory: js/lib\n         run: |\n-          zip -r ../bs-map-classifier-v${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}.zip \\\n+          zip -r ../bs-map-classifier-v${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}.zip \\\n             src/ dist/ models/ types/ package.json README.md\n \n-      - name: Stage versioned userscript copy\n+      - name: Stage versioned userscript copy (stable)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'stable'\n         working-directory: js\n-        run: cp dist/bs-pattern-overlay.user.js bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}.user.js\n+        run: cp dist/bs-pattern-overlay.user.js bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}.user.js\n \n-      # ── GitHub Release with all four assets ───────────────────────────────\n-      - name: Create GitHub Release\n+      # ── GitHub Release ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+      - name: Create GitHub Release (stable)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'stable'\n         uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\n         with:\n-          tag_name: ${{ github.event.workflow_run.head_branch }}\n+          tag_name: ${{ steps.rel.outputs.tag }}\n           generate_release_notes: true\n+          prerelease: false\n           files: |\n             js/dist/bs-pattern-overlay.user.js\n-            js/bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}.user.js\n-            js/bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}.zip\n-            js/bs-map-classifier-v${{ steps.ver.outputs.VERSION }}.zip\n+            js/bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}.user.js\n+            js/bs-pattern-overlay-v${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}.zip\n+            js/bs-map-classifier-v${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}.zip\n \n-      # ── Publish library to npm ─────────────────────────────────────────────\n-      - name: Publish to npm\n+      - name: Create GitHub Pre-Release (beta)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'beta'\n+        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\n+        with:\n+          tag_name: ${{ steps.rel.outputs.tag }}\n+          generate_release_notes: true\n+          prerelease: true\n+          name: \"${{ steps.rel.outputs.tag }} (beta)\"\n+          files: |\n+            js/bs-map-classifier-v${{ steps.rel.outputs.VERSION }}.zip\n+\n+      # ── Publish to npm ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n+      - name: Publish to npm (stable)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'stable'\n+        working-directory: js/lib\n+        run: npm publish --access public --provenance\n+\n+      - name: Publish to npm (beta)\n+        if: steps.rel.outputs.type == 'beta'\n         working-directory: js/lib\n-        run: npm publish --access public --provenance\n\\ No newline at end of file\n+        env:\n+          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\n+        run: npm publish --access public --tag beta"}]}